# Build output
bin/
obj/
dist/
*.user

# Decompiler output.
#
# tools/decompile/out/ holds a full IL2CPP dump of Sons Of The Forest — dump.cs,
# il2cpp.h, script.json and ~210 reconstructed assemblies under DummyDll/. That is
# Endnight's copyrighted game code, so it is never committed. Regenerate it locally
# against your own copy of the game if you need it (see docs in tools/).
#
# The Il2CppDumper binaries are likewise third-party and not redistributed here.
tools/decompile/out/
tools/decompile/Il2CppDumper/
tools/decompile/*.zip

# Local machine state
gamedir.txt
.claude/
*.log
